  "title": "Don&#39;t Want to Cook Monday Chicken",
  "description": "Tired of everything being spicy and looking for a quick, nice dinner with a subtle flavor? Try this! Chicken breasts are laid on a bed of broccoli, and blanketed with a mushroom sauce with a hint of horseradish. Great with garlic bread! Of course - if subtle isn&#39;t what you&#39;re looking for - you can spice this up all you want!",
