      ],
      "image": "assets/images/74144/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a medium bowl, stir together the condensed soup, sour cream and horseradish. Pour or spread evenly over the chicken and broccoli.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/W4fb4NCOZOq6NiQB8QJ6vcrwXeA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/74144-dont-want-to-cook-monday-chicken-VAT-step-03-d30ef88054184651a6c1be54e0272259.jpg"
